# Labelled trigger eval set — Architecture v2 §7.3 / §13.2.
# One utterance per line. `expect` is the answer this pipeline owes:
#   answer = a direct question addressed to the user (fire)
#   note   = action item / decision / ownership (meeting cue, note only)
#   none   = small talk, narration, or the user's own speech (never answer)
